OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSATube strikes on track as pressure
OL,4,Agrows on mayor
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking to BBC Politics London,
OL,7,FLiberal Democrat MP Bobby Dean said
OL,8,FLord Khan "needed to get involved
OL,9,Fhimself and sort it out", while Labour
OL,10,FMP Dame Meg Hillier said the mayor
OL,11,Fshould do "everything he can" to stop
OL,12,Fthe strikes.
OL,14,FA mayoral spokesperson said Lord Khan
OL,15,Fhad urged TfL and the RMT to keep
OL,16,Ftalking. The RMT said it had suspended
OL,17,Fstrikes three times already to allow
OL,18,Ffor negotiations.
